  # ── Boxes and spheres in the aisle: geometry on SEVERAL SIDES of the lamps, so
  #    all six cube faces of a point light are exercised rather than just the
  #    downward one. A seam between two faces shows up here as a straight edge
  #    running through a shadow that has no geometry to explain it. ──
